        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/51bf81/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-05-03T16:13:26.923Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello!</p>\n<p>I have no idea where to ask this, it is <em>not</em> easy to navigate either the store site or these forums…</p>\n<p>But, I made a purchase this morning and made a store account. I’ve already been charged the money for the product from my bank and I did get a welcome e-mail from the store, so I know the right e-mail was entered. The welcome e-mail explained I would need to set my password but the link I clicked said it was invalid and already been clicked and to try resetting my password.</p>\n<p>I sent the password reset request almost 40 minutes ago and I haven’t seen anything show in my e-mail. I have no idea how to resolve this or who to contact, so I’m sorry if this is not the right platform for this.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-05-03T16:13:26.923Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
